sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Spark Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as Spark Controller<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant SparkSubmit as spark-submit<br/>(local process)
    participant Driver as Driver Pod<br/>4040/TCP Spark UI
    participant Executors as Executor Pods<br/>7078-7079/TCP
    participant REST as REST Submitter<br/>(optional, mTLS)
    participant ConnectSvc as SparkConnect Server<br/>15002/TCP gRPC
    participant Client as SparkConnect Client

    Note over User, Executors: Flow 1: SparkApplication Submission (spark-submit)
    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkApplication CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>mTLS (cluster TLS profile)
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Check ResourceQuota<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admit/Reject
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR Created
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch SparkApplication<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Controller->>SparkSubmit: Exec spark-submit<br/>SPARK_HOME env
    SparkSubmit->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Pod Admission<br/>mTLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutate Pod (inject volumes, env, labels)
    Driver->>Executors: Spark RPC<br/>7078/TCP, 7079/TCP<br/>No encryption
    Executors-->>Driver: Task results
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update SparkApplication/status<br/>ServiceAccount token

    Note over User, REST: Flow 2: SparkApplication Submission (REST Submitter)
    User->>K8sAPI: POST SparkApplication CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Controller->>REST: POST submit request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, optional mTLS<br/>Client certificate auth
    REST->>K8sAPI: Create Driver Pod<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Driver->>Executors: Spark RPC<br/>7078/TCP, 7079/TCP

    Note over User, Controller: Flow 3: Webhook Admission Detail
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: AdmissionReview request<br/>443/TCP → 9443/TCP<br/>TLS 1.2+ (OpenShift profile)<br/>mTLS
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: ResourceQuota validation<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse<br/>(failurePolicy: Fail)

    Note over Client, Executors: Flow 4: SparkConnect Server
    Client->>ConnectSvc: gRPC request<br/>15002/TCP<br/>No encryption
    ConnectSvc->>K8sAPI: Create Executor Pods<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>ServiceAccount token
    ConnectSvc->>Executors: Spark RPC<br/>7078/TCP, 7079/TCP
    Executors-->>ConnectSvc: Task results
    ConnectSvc-->>Client: gRPC response
